<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/8/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue is hereby authorised of a sum not exceeding five billion four hundred and sixty million seven hundred and twelve thousand eight hundred and twenty-one ringgit (RM5,460,712,821) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services and purposes specified in the First Schedule for the year 2000, not provided for or not fully provided for by the Supply Act 2000 [Act A1071], the Supplementary Supply (2000) Act 2000 [Act A 1083] and the Supplementary Supply (2000) (No. 2) Act 2000 [ActA1091]. Further expenditure for the year 2001"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/8/eng@> .
